on, gift giving, and more!<br><br> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2321960/extras/ea5917342b964c755253150da05f93ab.poster.avif?t=1785252223\" width=1170 height=106 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2321960/extras/ea5917342b964c755253150da05f93ab.webm?t=1785252223\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2321960/extras/ea5917342b964c755253150da05f93ab.mp4?t=1785252223\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2321960/extras/485dbd0cf76bc4c09b5dcd37c3d3f78c.poster.avif?t=1785252223\" width=1000 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2321960/extras/485dbd0cf76bc4c09b5dcd37c3d3f78c.webm?t=1785252223\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Cursed storms batter the shrines and beacons that protect these lands, but weathering them will bring its own rewards. While adventuring through Wilderness peaks, you'll find comfort at bonfires while you wait out the storm with other players. Afterward, enjoy a Rainbow Time buff together while you harvest colorful Beacon Energy drops scattered throughout the islands!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2321960/extras/746aae7896801457edaf88653085074d.poster.avif?t=1785252223\" width=1170 height=106 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2321960/extras/746aae7896801457edaf88653085074d.webm?t=1785252223\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2321960/extras/746aae7896801457edaf88653085074d.mp4?t=1785252223\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2321960/extras/4a53fcda07a4e59f8a48ba2498521f73.poster.avif?t=1785252223\" width=1000 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2321960/extras/4a53fcda07a4e59f8a48ba2498521f73.webm?t=1785252223\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">While exploring, you’ll meet both people and spirits who need your help. Sometimes they'll need medicine or a snack, other times they'll ask for a favor and some kindness. With patience, these characters will begin to reveal more about themselves, gifting items and stories. Spirits in particular will communicate in some curious ways!<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2321960/extras/a46dabccad484c44b4509d347c21af26.poster.avif?t=1785252223\" width=1170 height=106 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2321960/extras/a46dabccad484c44b4509d347c21af26.webm?t=1785252223\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2321960/extras/a46dabccad484c44b4509d347c21af26.mp4?t=1785252223\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2321960/extras/1514c382180941c30e8274a453784b8b.poster.avif?t=1785252223\" width=1000 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2321960/extras/1514c382180941c30e8274a453784b8b.webm?t=1785252223\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Fix up and decorate a comfy house on your very own mountain peak! Your home and the surrounding landscape can be built, managed, and decorated as you see fit, perfect for hosting gatherings with friends. Oh, and the place may even come with a tiny roommate. 🐻</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2321960/extras/bded6fe9a753a8ae650e5fabf6c911fd.poster.avif?t=1785252223\" width=1170 height=106 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2321960/extras/bded6fe9a753a8ae650e5fabf6c911fd.webm?t=1785252223\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2321960/extras/bded6fe9a753a8ae650e5fabf6c911fd.mp4?t=1785252223\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">⟢ Villagers, spirits, little bears, and other players to meet and befriend</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">⟢ An at-your-own-pace friendship progression system with rewards for playing together<br>⟢ A variety of musical instruments for group jam sessions and solo improv</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">⟢ Solo and co-op mini-game activities, puzzles, and tournaments</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">⟢ Mystical new mountaintop ruins every few days to climb, explore, and rebuild</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">⟢ Expressive character customization options - including hairstyles, dyes, and mix &amp; match outfits</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">⟢ A modular housing system ready to be personalized on your own mountain peak</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">⟢ Atmospheric and delightful seasonal soundtracks </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">⟢ Impeccable social vibes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><br> <br><strong><i>Note: Game progress does not transfer between the Steam and mobile versions of Spirit Crossing.</i></strong></p>", "short_description": "Rebuild the connection between worlds in Spirit Crossing, a collaborative life-sim MMO from the makers of &quot;Cozy Grove.&quot; Explore distant mountaintop ruins, save lost spirits, befriend tiny bears, and build sanctuaries with other players while you carve out a cozy mountainside home of your own.", "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Korean, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil, Spanish - Latin America, Turkish, Traditional Chinese, Simplified Chinese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2321960/ef5229ee7c51162c7233296443ef0520408387cd/header.jpg?t=1785252223", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2321960/7973c73a8e41786fb4b670cfc3c34cea30d4bab7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1785252223", 